# Real project: 3DCharacterSpinning. Built through its own wrapper, which puts the
# V810 tools on PATH, runs Makefile.pcfx, then bincat and pcfx-cdlink -- do not
# substitute a bare `make`.
# This real-project case needs the optional external 3DCharacterSpinning source.
# Set PCFX_EVAL_SOURCE before running it; no machine-specific source path is stored.
SOURCE=
BUILD_CMD=./build_with_toolchain.sh "$V810_GCC" clean all
CUE=airgt_racer_ram.cue
FRAMES=2400
REFERENCE=reference.png
MAX_DIFF_PIXELS=0
